FROM THE GM'S DESK
------------------
We set a new peak-day record on July 29: 8.6 million gallons. Thank you to
the control room for running three intake pumps for most of that week
without a single customer pressure complaint. Our 2025 Water Quality Report
is published at www.{{ ww_domain }}/reports.   - Greg L.

